{"unit_id":"bpc-oss__chrome-faithful#card-zh","repo":"bpc-oss/chrome-faithful","commit":"7cefa8211b2eef694296dfd15ff1400a0f3df526","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Chrome Faithful 将 DSH 智能体接入本机 Chrome 配置文件，支持配置文件选择、标签页操作、页面交互、截图和内容提取。它通过 MCP 服务、本机桥接和浏览器扩展工作，适合需要使用现有浏览器会话的自动化；需要安装 Chrome、Node.js 并配置桥接。工具还可读取页面视觉文字，帮助纯文本模型理解浏览器画面。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin-chrome-faithful/cordis.patch.yml:1-14","src/mcp-server.mjs:98-148"]}
{"unit_id":"bpc-oss__chrome-faithful#card-en","repo":"bpc-oss/chrome-faithful","commit":"7cefa8211b2eef694296dfd15ff1400a0f3df526","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Chrome Faithful connects DSH agents to a selected Chrome profile through MCP, a local bridge, and a browser extension. It supports profile selection, tab management, page interaction, screenshots, and page content extraction. It requires local Chrome, Node.js, and bridge configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin-chrome-faithful/cordis.patch.yml:1-14","src/mcp-server.mjs:98-148"]}
